## Decisions Made (technical forks — owned by Тео, NOT for Director)

- **Scope = converge all executor-dispatch to ONE matrix-consulting choke-point.** Reason:
  only this closes R2 (critic-bypass) — the defect the matrix exists to fix; also subtraction
  (N doors→1), anti-additivity. Matrix-on-decideGate-only leaves 9 bypasses → rejected.
- **Model = extend the dead `approval_authority_matrix`** (owner-enum += `auto`, add
  per-episode overlay, category↔gate-key map). Reason: reuse ~80%-built owner-matrix;
  a new metadata model duplicates it = the additivity the rule forbids → rejected.
- **Keys = milestone-keyed (~7):** brief/cast/ref-plan/shot-plan/animatic/video/publish.
  Reason: match real Director decision points, stable; one EXEC-EREF with 3 entries = one
  gate. Per-AgentId conflates producer/critic/executor + breaks on fanout (fires designer,
  not executor) → rejected. GATE_CLASS(AgentId) stays for measurement only.

